  "priorExpiration": "2013-07-22",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 802.01 Definition of Terms. Terms used in this chapter shall be defined as follows unless a different meaning is clearly apparent from the text:\n\n(a) “Self-dialing telephone alarm” means “self-dialing telephone alarm” as defined in RSA 370-A:1, II. The term includes “alarm”;\n\n(b) “Department” means the New Hampshire department of safety;\n\n(c) “Person” means a natural person, a corporation, partnership, association, or other legal entity;\n\n(d) “Receiving agency” means “governmental agency” as defined in RSA 370-A:1, I. The term does not include “911”; and\n\n(e) “User” means a person who utilizes a self-dialing telephone alarm.\n\nSource. #2282, eff 1-16-83; ss by #2791, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5068, eff 2-21-91; ss by #6457, INTERIM, eff 2-21-97, EXPIRES: 6-21-97; ss by #6474, eff 3-25-97; ss by #8307, INTERIM, eff 3-25-05, EXPIRES: 9-21-05; ss by #8392, eff 7-22-05; EXPIRED: 7-22-13\n\nNew. #12771, eff 5-2-19",
